{%- assign title = scenario.names.exercise | default: scenario.name -%}
{%- assign standards = scenario.scenario.standards -%}
{%- assign method = scenario.engagement.evaluation -%}
{%- if method == "Rated per task (T, P, U)" -%}{%- assign rating = "T, P or U" -%}{%- elsif method == "Go or no-go per task" -%}{%- assign rating = "Go or no-go" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign rating = "Notes" -%}{%- endif -%}
<h1>{{ title }}: After Action Review</h1>
<p>Run it straight after the exercise, with the whole team. Take the four questions in order, and write the answers in the boxes.</p>

<h2>1. What Was Supposed to Happen?</h2>
{%- if scenario.objectives %}
<table>
<tr><th>Task</th><th>Standard</th><th style="width: 90px">{{ rating }}</th><th style="width: 34%">What we saw</th></tr>
{%- for t in scenario.objectives %}
<tr><td><strong>{{ t.id }}</strong> {{ t.text }}</td><td>{{ standards[forloop.index0] }}</td><td></td><td style="height: 48px"></td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
</table>
{%- else %}
<p>No tasks are set yet.</p>
{%- endif %}

<h2>2. What Actually Happened?</h2>
<table>
<tr><th style="width: 90px">Time</th><th>What the team did</th></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td><td></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3. Why Was There a Difference?</h2>
{%- if scenario.groundTruth %}
<p>What was really going on:</p>
<ul>
{%- for g in scenario.groundTruth %}
<li>{{ g.text }}</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endif %}
<table>
<tr><th>Cause</th></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>4. What Will We Sustain or Improve?</h2>
{%- if scenario.teachingPoints %}
<p>Points to bring out:</p>
<ul>
{%- for p in scenario.teachingPoints %}
<li>{{ p.text }}</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endif %}
<table>
<tr><th style="width: 50%">Sustain</th><th>Improve</th></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td style="height: 40px"></td><td></td></tr>
</table>
